# A homed printer mounts T1, then UNSELECT_TOOL docks it: the change hook
# templates see no new tool, T1's gcode offset leaves the gcode origin and
# the extruder stepper is detached. A second UNSELECT_TOOL finds no tool
# mounted and does nothing.
CONFIG printer.cfg
DICTIONARY linuxprocess.dict

G28
T1
GET_POSITION
UNSELECT_TOOL
GET_POSITION
HOTENDCHANGER_STATUS
UNSELECT_TOOL
M400
